para" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: center;">Mark, sign and date your proxy card and return it in the postage-paid envelope included in your proxy materials. Your proxy card must arrive by June&#160;17, 2026.</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 139.67pt; padding-top: 2.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: -24pt; text-align: center;">Use a touch-tone telephone to transmit your voting instructions at any time up to 11:59 p.m. ET, on June&#160;17, 2026. Dial the toll-free number listed on your enclosed proxy card and follow the instructions to vote.</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 139.66pt; padding-top: 2.01pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: -24pt; text-align: center;">Use the internet to transmit your voting instructions at any time up to 11:59 p.m. ET, on June&#160;17, 2026. Visit the website listed on your enclosed proxy card and follow the instructions to vote.</div></td><td style="width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 139.67pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 139.67pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 139.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 456pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_gftxt" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 4pt; width: 456pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 456pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 456pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;"><span style="position: relative; top: -3pt;">1</span><br/></div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 456pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div>
