fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 12pt; text-align: left;">Sheryl L. Conley</div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 68.72pt; padding-top: 1.76pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 14.36pt; text-align: left;"><span style="padding-left: 12.5pt;">42,568</span><sup>(2)</sup></div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 52.65pt; padding-top: 1.76pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 15.07pt; text-align: left;"><span style="padding-left: 22.5pt;">* </span></div></td><td style="width: 4pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 4pt; background-color: #C8D5E6;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 288pt; padding-top: 1.76pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #C8D5E6;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 12pt; text-align: left;">Gary P. Fischetti</div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt; background-color: #C8D5E6;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 9.66pt; background-color: #C8D5E6;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 68.72pt; padding-top: 1.76pt; padding-bottom: 2.13pt;